From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:42:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] nir/lower_cl_images: record buffer textures in
 texture_buffers

shader_info::texture_buffers was only filled by the GLSL path
(gl_nir_lower_samplers_as_deref). OpenCL kernels lowered through
nir_lower_cl_images left it empty, so on Bifrost (v6-v7) panfrost, which
reads texel buffers through the attribute table and sizes that table from
texture_buffers (pan_compiler.c), compiled read_image*(image1d_buffer_t)
to an LEA_ATTR/LD_CVT pair with attribute_count = 0. The driver then
emitted no attribute descriptors at all for the compute job and the
sampler-less 1D buffer reads returned zeros: every format of the
OpenCL-CTS Images (Samplerless int/uint/float) 1Dbuffer tests failed at
the first size ("Sampler-less reads differ from reads with sampler").

Set texture_buffers for the read-only (texture) buffer images, keeping
image_buffers for the writable ones, mirroring the GLSL path. With this
the compute job carries one attribute (R8I, 1D buffer, stride 1, size
329 for the CTS case) and LD_CVT reads the buffer.

Generated-by: LLM
---
 src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_cl_images.c | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_cl_images.c b/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_cl_images.c
index 760e8449040..b3c1346c35e 100644
--- a/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_cl_images.c
+++ b/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_cl_images.c
@@ -121,6 +121,7 @@ nir_lower_cl_images(nir_shader *shader, bool lower_image_derefs, bool lower_samp
    int num_rd_images = 0, num_wr_images = 0;
 
    BITSET_ZERO(shader->info.image_buffers);
+   BITSET_ZERO(shader->info.texture_buffers);
    BITSET_ZERO(shader->info.msaa_images);
    nir_foreach_variable_with_modes(var, shader, nir_var_image | nir_var_uniform) {
       if (!glsl_type_is_image(var->type) && !glsl_type_is_texture(var->type))
@@ -139,7 +140,15 @@ nir_lower_cl_images(nir_shader *shader, bool lower_image_derefs, bool lower_samp
 
       switch (glsl_get_sampler_dim(var->type)) {
       case GLSL_SAMPLER_DIM_BUF:
-         BITSET_SET(shader->info.image_buffers, var->data.binding);
+         /* Read-only images are textures: record buffer textures in
+          * texture_buffers (as the GLSL path does), so drivers that need
+          * extra descriptors for texel buffers (Bifrost attributes) can
+          * count them.
+          */
+         if (var->data.access & ACCESS_NON_WRITEABLE)
+            BITSET_SET(shader->info.texture_buffers, var->data.binding);
+         else
+            BITSET_SET(shader->info.image_buffers, var->data.binding);
          break;
       case GLSL_SAMPLER_DIM_MS:
          BITSET_SET(shader->info.msaa_images, var->data.binding);
